  "description": "POWERFUL 48V ELECTRIC DRIVE — CONFIDENT EVERYDAY PERFORMANCE\nPowered by a 48V brushless motor system, the T18 delivers responsive electric assistance for commuting, neighborhood cruising and everyday rides, with up to 15° climbing capability.\n\n48V 15.6Ah BATTERY — MORE ENERGY FOR LONGER RIDES\nThe 48V 15.6Ah battery provides approximately 750Wh of capacity for daily commuting and recreational riding. The included 54.6V/2A charger takes approximately 7–8 hours for a full charge.\n\n16*4\" WHEELS & 120KG CAPACITY — STABLE & MANEUVERABLE\nThe 16-inch wheels and high-carbon-steel frame provide a stable, solid ride, while the 120kg maximum load capacity makes the T18 suitable for a wide range of riders.\n\nSHIMANO 7-SPEED — ADAPT TO CHANGING TERRAIN\nThe Shimano 7-speed derailleur offers easier gearing for climbs and rough terrain, plus higher gears for efficient riding on flat roads.\n\nPRACTICAL EVERYDAY DESIGN — LIGHT, RACK & IP54\nEquipped with a front light, rear rack, kickstand and front fender, the T18 is built for everyday practicality. IP54 protection adds confidence for normal outdoor riding conditions.",
